~ THE WIT WEBSITE — a modern landing page, built entirely in Wit and
~ assembled from many files into one page. Design system in theme.wit,
~ behaviour in script.wit, each section in parts/.
~
~ Build:  wit build site.wit -o site.html --raw
~ Then open site.html in a browser (the ◐ toggle switches dark/light).

reference ./parts/config.wit
reference ./theme.wit
reference ./script.wit
reference ./parts/nav.wit
reference ./parts/hero.wit
reference ./parts/features.wit
reference ./parts/examples.wit
reference ./parts/stats.wit
reference ./parts/footer.wit

~ design system (theme.wit)
@stylesheet stylesheet@

~ the page, in order
@page_nav page_nav@
@page_hero page_hero@
@page_features page_features@
@page_examples page_examples@
@page_stats page_stats@
@page_footer page_footer@

~ behaviour (script.wit) — last, so the DOM exists
@scripts scripts@
